<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/head', { title: 'About & Vision • Alumni.io' }) %>
    <style>
        .about-hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 70px 0 50px;
        }
        .about-values-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 30px 0 50px;
        }
        .value-card {
            background: var(--canvas-card);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            padding: 32px 26px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-apple);
        }
        .value-card h3 {
            font-size: 19px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--ink);
            margin: 14px 0 8px;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }
        .value-card p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--ink-secondary);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .tech-pill {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            background: var(--canvas-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--hairline-soft);
            border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--ink);
        }
        @media (max-width: 800px) {
            .about-values-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/navbar', { active: 'about' }) %>

    <main class="container">
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <section class="about-hero">
            <span class="eyebrow" style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--ink-muted); margin-bottom: 8px; display: inline-block;">
                Mission & Vision
            </span>
            <h1 style="font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 54px); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.035em; line-height: 1.1; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 16px;">
                Building the future of alumni networks.
            </h1>
            <p style="font-size: 18px; color: var(--ink-secondary); max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.55; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">
                Bridging universities, students, and graduates through a transparent, high-performance, 
                and resilient digital ecosystem inspired by RunwayML and Apple design principles.
            </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Values Cards -->
        <!-- Values Cards -->
        <div class="about-values-grid">
            <div class="value-card">
                <div style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                    <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="opacity: 0.85;"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Sustainable Alumni Network</h3>
                <p>
                    Graduation is just the beginning. We empower students to connect with accomplished alumni for mentorship, collaborative ventures, and industry guidance.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="value-card">
                <div style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                    <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="opacity: 0.85;"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Transparent Career Pathways</h3>
                <p>
                    Verified job opportunities and internships posted directly by alumni. A robust M:N relational pipeline tracks candidate evaluations end-to-end.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="value-card">
                <div style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                    <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="opacity: 0.85;"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Guardian Reliability</h3>
                <p>
                    Engineered with modular Node.js & Express, real-time analytics logging, 404 & 5xx Guardian middleware, and audit logs for industry-grade uptime.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tech Stack & Architecture Strip -->
        <div class="card" style="padding: 36px 32px;">
            <h2>
                <span>Technology Stack & Architecture</span>
                <span class="badge badge-api">Production Stack</span>
            </h2>
            <p style="color: var(--ink-secondary); margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 14.5px;">
                The platform is designed around a decoupled MVC (Model-View-Controller) architecture adhering strictly to RESTful specifications:
            </p>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 28px;">
                <span class="tech-pill">Node.js (Runtime)</span>
                <span class="tech-pill">Express.js (REST API & Routing)</span>
                <span class="tech-pill">MySQL 8.0 (ACID Relational DB)</span>
                <span class="tech-pill">EJS (Server-side Views)</span>
                <span class="tech-pill">Docker & Docker Compose</span>
                <span class="tech-pill">Swagger UI (OpenAPI 3.0)</span>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline-soft); padding-top: 20px;">
                <a href="/api/swagger" target="_blank" class="btn btn-runway">Launch Swagger UI Console ↗</a>
                <a href="/api/health" target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary">System Health Check (JSON)</a>
                <a href="/" class="btn btn-outline">Back to Homepage</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
